1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,171
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:06,940
Asexual reproduction makes clones, sexual reproduction makes variation.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:15,494
Pollination is autogamy, geitonogamy or xenogamy, carried by wind, water, insects, birds or bats.

4
00:00:15,494 --> 00:00:20,416
Double fertilization gives a two n zygote and a three n endosperm.

5
00:00:20,416 --> 00:00:27,539
The anther wall is epidermis, endothecium, middle layers and tapetum, which feeds the pollen.

6
00:00:27,539 --> 00:00:31,588
The embryo sac has seven cells and eight nuclei.

7
00:00:31,588 --> 00:00:39,388
The Capsella embryo goes octant, globular, heart, torpedo; the maize embryo has a scutellum.

8
00:00:39,388 --> 00:00:43,736
And endosperm is nuclear, cellular or helobial.

